## Interface: 16001
## Title: Daylight |cff73a0ffEssentials|r
## Notes: A DaylightUI plugin of small combat aids: your healers' mana, a combat timer and alert, a pet reminder, your taunt and dispel cooldowns at the cursor, a list of enemy players nearby with a Kill on Sight list, your secondary stats, and one-click buffs for players who buffed you. Each on its own switch.
